                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "40758ffa-cb7d-37a7-90cf-b4c85b692b3d",
                                        "entry_id": "a6a54f24-2bc9-38c9-aea8-64ffeb5f5fdc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surname."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66507e3f-eec3-4d05-9b64-588689627d58",
                                                "sense_id": "40758ffa-cb7d-37a7-90cf-b4c85b692b3d",
                                                "text": "MR. HOWE: I would like to ask Mr. Mecca this question : does he think there would be substantial duplication between the agency that he is suggesting, and the current Governors' Committees on Employment of the Handicapped.\nMR. MECCA: […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5e7eb755-8222-3ede-bde3-04a0101cedb7",
                                        "entry_id": "a6a54f24-2bc9-38c9-aea8-64ffeb5f5fdc",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A unisex given name, mostly borne by women."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncommon"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e81569cb-459c-4179-b498-331fe05f8c45",
                                                "sense_id": "5e7eb755-8222-3ede-bde3-04a0101cedb7",
                                                "text": "Mrs. Mecca Marie Varney and son are successful lecturers and debaters on various topics of current interest, such as suffrage, etc. Her home is in Paw Paw, Mich. Her lectures are managed by her husband, Charles E. Varney."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa1e01a9-081c-43d7-af5d-d28c359d3a2d",
                                                "sense_id": "5e7eb755-8222-3ede-bde3-04a0101cedb7",
                                                "text": "Just then, a young boy—named Mecca, as we learned later—arrived at the scene with the flight attendants who had been escorting him to his parents. In the midst of the frantic feeding of the protein bar, Mecca quietly announced:"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "Mecca",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b971bf9d-a830-381a-a3ac-0d32323e0a58",
                                        "entry_id": "33002f2f-c67c-399d-b205-daa4eef66eca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any place considered to be a very important place to visit by people with a particular interest."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively",
                                            "offensive",
                                            "sometimes"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9da3567b-3147-437b-9363-1854c76f3b89",
                                                "sense_id": "b971bf9d-a830-381a-a3ac-0d32323e0a58",
                                                "text": "It was consequently the “Mecca,” the “Delphic Oracle,” the “Vale of Egeria,” to which all studious pilgrims should resort to drink of the pure springs of knowledge; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02373af9-34b5-4a00-9424-1042d81a89eb",
                                                "sense_id": "b971bf9d-a830-381a-a3ac-0d32323e0a58",
                                                "text": "By one o'clock the place was choc-a-bloc. […] The restaurant was packed, and the promenade between the two main courts and the subsidiary courts was thronged with healthy-looking youngish people, drawn to the Mecca of tennis from all parts of the country."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70d6b903-ee1e-4b1f-b9ac-9f15ee5ed56c",
                                                "sense_id": "b971bf9d-a830-381a-a3ac-0d32323e0a58",
                                                "text": "Tsuhu, or Lake Benevolence, is located in Fuhsing District, Taoyuan County, and formed by waters from the Tahan Creek (river). Its two sections of limpid water are enclosed within emerald green hills. When he was alive, the late President often came here as a place of retreat and meditation. It had been for this reason that his casket was moved here for temporary rest. The place has since become a Mecca for people all over the world to come and pay homage to Modern China's greatest leader."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8951929e-b4cf-4d2e-ba3f-d630bcc260a8",
                                                "sense_id": "b971bf9d-a830-381a-a3ac-0d32323e0a58",
                                                "text": "On the other side of the Atlantic, stores in Paris's chic Avenue Montaigne, a mecca for Japanese tourists, said that sales to foreigners had fallen sharply."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4a379b65-b16c-4d26-bcd8-cbd6e5093c00",
                                                "sense_id": "b971bf9d-a830-381a-a3ac-0d32323e0a58",
                                                "text": "Living in Venice, California and training at the Mecca of bodybuilding, Gold's Gym, I've seen some of the world's most dedicated and hard-training athletes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "84ff6c20-91f5-4463-8135-8fb4ce03d2b2",
                                                "sense_id": "b971bf9d-a830-381a-a3ac-0d32323e0a58",
                                                "text": "I say how much I like the shabby lounge atmosphere of a ruin pub, and Laura declares that this one, Szimpla Kert (which means “Simple Garden”), is the mecca of ruin pubs."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b2d9c641-4ec5-4cc2-98b1-c676ae611202",
                        "source_entry_id": "d2a8b2ad-bdd8-344f-b417-3216229245a9",
                        "source_sense_id": "b01092ee-8c72-346a-abef-4601c1902e04",
                        "source_sense_description": "geboorteplaats van Mohammed en bedevaartplaats voor islamieten",
                        "target_lang_word": "La Mecque",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "La Mecque",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee71838d-9e45-3fc6-9445-a69749683b0b",
                                        "entry_id": "5b6f012c-f0d2-3957-ba9e-ae89732b6b74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ville d’Arabie saoudite, la ville sainte la plus importante de l’islam."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2ff43013-c648-45c7-8913-09348d1e32be",
                                                "sense_id": "ee71838d-9e45-3fc6-9445-a69749683b0b",
                                                "text": "L'âne peut aller à la Mecque, il n’en reviendra pas pèlerin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "607cb54d-2423-4108-9ce8-a315e7b95823",
                                                "sense_id": "ee71838d-9e45-3fc6-9445-a69749683b0b",
                                                "text": "Toursène et le batcha se tournèrent vers l’endroit où, par-delà monts, plaines et déserts, se trouvait La Mecque. C’était l’heure de la première prière, l’instant qui, dans la pureté de l’aurore, engage toute la longueur du jour."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a63a82f5-25dd-4be6-b154-6aab1ffbc114",
                                                "sense_id": "ee71838d-9e45-3fc6-9445-a69749683b0b",
                                                "text": "Quand il visite La Mecque, ses détracteurs ricanent à l’unisson : « Pèlerinage de complaisance ! »"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "589d94c7-f066-45e6-b8c3-a29753c6dd6b",
                                                "sense_id": "ee71838d-9e45-3fc6-9445-a69749683b0b",
                                                "text": "Tout au long de ce voyage symbolique vers la Mecque, Asad, à la manière des conteurs arabes, entremêle aventures, témoignages sur les événements du Proche-Orient et sur les coutumes et codes légendaires d'une Arabie qui n’existe plus."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97e8ea1b-cf3a-4377-8cb2-8922acf3ab19",
                                                "sense_id": "ee71838d-9e45-3fc6-9445-a69749683b0b",
                                                "text": "Varanasi est un des lieux les plus saints pour l’Hindouisme, comme peut l’être le Vatican pour les catholiques ou la Mecque pour les musulmans."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d46fd481-bf50-34aa-a00e-2ba3da8697fa",
                                        "entry_id": "5b6f012c-f0d2-3957-ba9e-ae89732b6b74",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Haut lieu associé à une pratique, une passion, une religion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "40c382f4-bc9b-46ea-bc3c-c1822405ec64",
                                                "sense_id": "d46fd481-bf50-34aa-a00e-2ba3da8697fa",
                                                "text": "Gilbert n’aurait jamais osé espérer cet honneur. Vézelay, pour le Bourguignon qu’il était, c’était La Mecque."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
